Vulkan staging buffers: out of device memory, StagingBufferPool::CreateBufferOrRecover frees every
staging buffer the GPU is done with and tries again, then once more after waiting for the GPU.
Two race sessions ended at a course load (VK_ERROR_OUT_OF_DEVICE_MEMORY thrown from a texture
upload's staging buffer, largest free block 6-8 MiB): the error ended the app.
